          "rn.text": "Retinopathy of Prematurity (ROP) is a serious retinal vessel disorder affecting preterm infants. Without timely detection, it can rapidly progress to irreversible vision loss.",
          "rn.text2": "The critical diagnostic window is 3 to 6 weeks after birth. Our clinic is equipped with specialized instrumentation and medical expertise for gentle, prompt infant care.",
